2. IMPLEMENTING THE FORMAT
==============================================================================

The .bge file format is open. Anyone may implement readers, writers, and tools
for it, in any programming language, for any purpose including commercial use,
with no licensing fee and no need to request permission. Software that
implements the format is your own work; it is not a derivative work of this
specification.

